<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>AsciiDoc on FreeBSD Documentation Portal</title><link>https://docs.freebsd.org/en/tags/AsciiDoc/</link><description>Recent content in AsciiDoc on FreeBSD Documentation Portal</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><copyright>BSD 2-clause 'Simplified' License</copyright><atom:link href="https://docs.freebsd.org/en/tags/AsciiDoc/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Chapter 6. Asciidoctor Primer</title><link>https://docs.freebsd.org/en/books/fdp-primer/asciidoctor-primer/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://docs.freebsd.org/en/books/fdp-primer/asciidoctor-primer/</guid><description>&lt;div id="preamble"&gt;
&lt;div class="sectionbody"&gt;

&lt;div class="paragraph"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most FDP documentation is written with AsciiDoc.
This chapter explains what that means, how to read and understand the documentation source, and the techniques used.
To get a complete reference of the Asciidoctor capabilities please consult the &lt;a href="https://docs.asciidoctor.org/home/"&gt;Asciidoctor documentation&lt;/a&gt;.
Some of the examples used in this chapter have been taken from the &lt;a href="https://docs.asciidoctor.org/asciidoc/latest/syntax-quick-reference"&gt;AsciiDoc Syntax Quick Reference&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sect1"&gt;
&lt;h2 id="asciidoctor-primer-overview"&gt;6.1. Overview&lt;a class="anchor" href="#asciidoctor-primer-overview"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="sectionbody"&gt;
&lt;div class="paragraph"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the original days of computers, electronic text was simple.
There were a few character sets like ASCII or EBCDIC, but that was about it.
Text was text, and what you saw really was what you got.
No frills, no formatting, no intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Chapter 7. Rosetta Stone</title><link>https://docs.freebsd.org/en/books/fdp-primer/rosetta/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://docs.freebsd.org/en/books/fdp-primer/rosetta/</guid><description>&lt;div id="preamble"&gt;
&lt;div class="sectionbody"&gt;

